  "next_id": 60,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -70,
        -40
      ],
      "id": 59,
      "text": "SPI1 of the Blue Pill (PA5 SCK, PA6 MISO, PA7 MOSI) with an MCP3208 A/D converter (CS PA4), an MCP41010 digital\npotentiometer (CS PB0) and a W25Q32 flash (CS PB1); an HX711 with a 5 kg load cell on PB10/PB11. Run and open the UART\nterminal: CH0 follows RV1, the firmware copies it to the MCP41010, and CH1 reads its wiper back; LOAD shows the weight.\nDrag RV1 or the load cell while running."
    }
  ],
